        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Multiple Choice Test</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            color: #333;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 40px;\n            max-width: 850px;\n        }\n        .question-block {\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .question-text {\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n            text-align: justify;\n        }\n        .options-4 {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 25% 25% 25% 25%;\n        }\n        .options-2 {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 50% 50%;\n            row-gap: 8px;\n        }\n        .option {\n            display: flex;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n            66. Mary is a conscientious and moral student. She works very hard and is _______ to her teachers.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options-4\">\n            <div class=\"option\">A. respected</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">B. respectable</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">C. respectful</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">D. respecting</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n            67. In that school, English is compulsory for all students, but French and Russian are _______.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options-4\">\n            <div class=\"option\">A. special</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">B. regional</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">C. optional</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">D. original</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n            68. Tom and Mary's house bought last year is _______ Lucy's.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options-2\">\n            <div class=\"option\">A. the three size of</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">B. three times the size of</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">C. as three times large as</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">D. three times as larger as</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n            69. We don 't believe the young man is _______ of finishing such a difficult task.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options-4\">\n            <div class=\"option\">A. competent</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">B. capable</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">C. qualified</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">D. Clever</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n            70. I' m _______ awake, but she is _______ asleep.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options-4\">\n            <div class=\"option\">A. very; very</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">B. very; much</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">C. much; well</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">D. wide; fast</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n            71. As for the quality of this model of color TV sets, the ones made in China are by no means _______ those imported.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options-4\">\n            <div class=\"option\">A. inferior than</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">B. less inferior to</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">C. less inferior than</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">D. inferior to</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n            72. To our great surprise, Mr. Baker has quickly recovered from his _______ illness.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options-4\">\n            <div class=\"option\">A. splendid</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">B. strict</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">C. simple</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">D. severe</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n            73. Compared with his sister, Jerry is even more _______ to, and more easily troubled by, emotional and relationship problems.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options-4\">\n            <div class=\"option\">A. skeptical</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">B. addicted</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">C. available</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">D. sensitive</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n            74. Smoking is so harmful to personal health that it kills _______ people each year than automobile accidents.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options-4\">\n            <div class=\"option\">A. six more times</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">B. six times more</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">C. over six times</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">D. six times</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n            75. Those poor teenagers were excited to find a shop at the corner where they could buy _______ priced bikes.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options-4\">\n            <div class=\"option\">A. competitively</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">B. recently</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">C. reasonably</div>\n            <div class=\"option\">D. highly</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n            76.